<article class="case-study" webc:root="override">
  <a class="post-back text-link" href="/blog"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> All thoughts</a>

  <header class="case-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Selected work · Vetsource</p>
    <h1 class="case-title">Kibble: building a design system from zero.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">I joined before development began and helped turn an early design-system initiative into a documented, versioned component library for product teams.</p>

    <dl class="case-facts">
      <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Senior Design System Engineer</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Stage</dt><dd>Pre-foundation through the v2.8 era</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Scope</dt><dd>Architecture, components, docs and delivery</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </header>

  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="context-title">
    <h2 id="context-title">01 / Context</h2>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>The project needed more than a collection of reusable UI. It needed a technical model that could preserve design decisions, support different product environments and make contribution predictable for the teams using it.</p>
      <p>My work began before the implementation phase. I helped decide the technologies, define how design tokens would become production UI, establish the component and styling architecture, and prepare the repository and Storybook foundation for the development that followed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="artifact-title">
    <h2 id="artifact-title">02 / Artifact</h2>

    <figure class="artifact-browser artifact-browser--wide">
      <div class="artifact-toolbar">
        <span class="artifact-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span>Kibble · Welcome</span>
        <a href="https://storybook.vetsource.design/?path=/docs/welcome--docs" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Open <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="artifact-viewport">
        <iframe src="https://storybook.vetsource.design/iframe.html?id=welcome--docs&viewMode=docs" title="Kibble design system welcome documentation" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
      <figcaption>The live introduction to Kibble and its role as Vetsource’s global design system.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="artifact-browser artifact-browser--component">
      <div class="artifact-toolbar">
        <span class="artifact-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span>Kibble · Button</span>
        <a href="https://storybook.vetsource.design/?path=/story/actions-button--primary" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Open <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
